fca_math produces a line diagram of the concept lattice of a formal context kk
with    latexdiagram(kk).

To do so fca_math writes a LaTeX file to the directory  " fca_math/latex ".
The name of the file is   " pydiag.tex ". Then LaTeX is invoked to produce
a PDF.

This requires the LaTeX files fca.sty and tikzlibrary{fca}. Do not remove these from the folder.

